% What lesson 24's reporting chain should say, weights aside.
% A fact must be derived; `:- fact.` must never be, and may use variables.
%
%   python3 diagnose.py programs/memory-confidence.dl --expect programs/memory-confidence.expect
%   python3 mutation.py programs/memory-confidence.dl --expect programs/memory-confidence.expect

reports_to(user, sam).
reports_to(user, marco).         % by way of sam, or of dana
:- reports_to(marco, user).
:- reports_to(sam, dana).        % two managers of the user, unrelated to each other
